","identifier":"tutorial-onboarding-3-4.swift","type":"file"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-onboarding-1-package-and-librairies#Import-the-Swift-Package-and-the-libraries":{"url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-onboarding-1-package-and-librairies#Import-the-Swift-Package-and-the-libraries","title":"Import the Swift Package and the libraries","role":"pseudoSymbol","type":"section","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-1-package-and-librairies#Import-the-Swift-Package-and-the-libraries","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS iOS is exposed through an open source Swift Package hosted on GitHub, and provides several librairies for your needs."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"These librairies help to split products and make users able to select only what they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI is the only official supported framework for Apple platforms."}],"kind":"section"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-onboarding-3-components-showcase#Navigations-and-themeable-view-a-step-further":{"url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-onboarding-3-components-showcase#Navigations-and-themeable-view-a-step-further","title":"Navigations and themeable view, a step further","role":"pseudoSymbol","type":"section","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-3-components-showcase#Navigations-and-themeable-view-a-step-further","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Now you are ready to use more components than a simple button!"}],"kind":"section"}}}